        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7503/52, Century Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Century Solid Brass Round Flush Pull is made by Omnia with the attention to quality that you'd expect from a leader in door hardware for over 50 years. This Round Cup Pull is pressure-mounted into the door for a sleek, screw-less installation. Choose from a wide array of finishes, including the ever popular polished chrome, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-stainless-steel-cup-pull-omnia-7503-52-us32d\"><b>Stainless Steel Round Cup Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\"><b>Solid Brass Square Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7503/52 Century Round Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
